attributes.description:
A list of attributes associated with the user.
The only attribute which is currently defined by the service is passkeyUsers which has the following structure and allows optional user handles to be set for passkey users. If this is not set then this field is set to a random ID when the first passkey is created for the user.
```"passkeyUsers": {
  "{relyingPartyId}": {
    "USER_HANDLE":"{passkey user handle}"
  }
} 
```
